[I] GTK dialog to relocalize XDG user directories on first login

[T] xdg-user-dirs-gtk provides a GTK dialog, run on first login after a locale
[T] change, that offers to update the names of the standard XDG user
[T] directories (Desktop, Documents, Downloads, etc.) to match the new language.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/xdg-user-dirs-gtk

[A] The GNOME Project <gnome-devel-list@gnome.org>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base extra/desktop/gnome

[L] GPL
